error[TYP005]: binary `<` requires operands of the same numeric type
 --> tests/golden/compile_fail/integer_operation_types.ska:2:14
   |
2 |     return 1 < 2u;
   |              ^ operator cannot be applied to these operand types
   |
2 |     return 1 < 2u;
